      "cooked": "<p>In 48 hours one of the people who posts in this thread will win a code to redeem a copy of <a href=\"http://www.gog.com/game/torchlight\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Torchlight</a> on g  <a href=\"http://og.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">og.com</a></p>\n<p>Torchlight is a single player hack&amp;slash game in the vein of Diablo and Gog is a digital distributor that doesn't believe in DRM. To enter just make a post in this thread; if you want to thank me then get creative in your post, tell me what the 'evil' DR.Monster is creating in his lab to deal with the heroes of the multiverse in your post (though this is not neccessary to enter).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Winner will be picked at 00.30 GMT on Saturday night (29th/30th June) via <a href=\"http://random.org\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">random.org</a></p>\n<p>One entry per person. Accounts need to have been created before I posted this thread.</p>",
